        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 33:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo vyose nabishizek’ umutima, kugira ngo mbisese vyose; kandi nabonye yukw abagororotsi n’abanyabgenge bari mu kuboko kw’Imana, bo n’ibikorwa vyabo, n’urukundo n’urwanko; abantu buntu nta co bazi; vyose bir’ imbere yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.9.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 9:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.2.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 2:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.5.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 5:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyose bibashikako kumwe bose: iherezo ni rimwe ku mugororotsi no ku munyakibi; ku munyangeso nziza no ku wejejwe no ku wuhumanye; ku muntu atanga ibimazi no ku muntu atabitanga: nk’uk’ umunyangeso nziza ameze, ni k’umunyavyaha ameze; nk’uk’ ūrahira ameze, ni k’ūtinya indahiro ameze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubu n’ubuyobe mu bikorerwa musi y’izuba vyose, yukw iherezo rya bose ari rimwe: mbere, mu mitima y’abana b’abantu huzuyemw’ ibibi, kandi bakiriho, ubusazi buba mu mitima yabo, hanyuma bakitāhira mu bapfuye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ni nde atazoba muri bo? Abariho bose baba bari n’ivyizigiro: kukw imbga ibona iruta intambge ipfuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 14:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.31.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 31:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.88.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "88:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.26.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 26:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ereg’ abariho baba bazi ko bazopfa; arikw abapfuye nta co baba bakizi, kandi nta mpēra baba bakibona; kuko kwibukwa kwabo kuba kwaramaze kwibagirana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urukundo rwabo n’urwanko rwabo n’ishari ryabo, vyose biba vyarashize: kandi ntibaba bagifise umugabane ku kintu na kimwe gikorerwa musi y’izuba gushitsa ibihe bidashira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
