            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.8.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 8:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni wīgīre, wīrīre ivyo kurya vyawe unezerewe, winywere vino yawe n’umutima uhimbawe; kukw Imana imaze kwemera ibikorwa vyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imyambaro yawe ni yame yera, kand’ umutwe wawe ntuz’ ubure gusīgwa amavuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.7.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana umunezero, mwe n’umugore wawe ukunda, imisi yose y’ ukubaho kwawe kw’ubusa, yaguhaye musi y’izuba, ni yo misi yawe yose ipfa ubusa: kukw ivyo ari vyo mugabane wawe wo mur’ ubu bugingo, no mu miruho yawe uruhira musi y’izuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 3:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikintu cose ukuboko kwawe kwerekeje gukora ugikorane inkomezi zawe; kukw ata gikorwa cank’ inama cank’ ukumenya cank’ ubgenge i kuzimu ah’ urāriye kuja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
